01_Jui7PSnhzHcijYNc7hUk8277","text":"正在使用工具：获取当前成员\n参数\n{}\n\n输出\n当前未选择成员。","tool_name":"get_current_member"},{"id":"B68C98F9-5BE7-4F07-9205-5DF96A0A08AF","created_at":"2026-05-19T05:46:00.000Z","anchor":{"type":"toolCall","value":"call_00_IkoX1fvsoLJG6NDbIMNY5643"},"updated_at":"2026-05-19T05:46:04.000Z","kind":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_IkoX1fvsoLJG6NDbIMNY5643","text":"正在使用工具：请求选择成员\n参数\n{\"reason\": \"需要确认当前是为哪位成员记录用药信息，以便后续任务和提醒关联到正确的人。\"}\n\n输出\n用户已完成成员选择。请使用返回的 member_id 继续后续工具调用或生成最终回答。\n{\"selection_completed\":true,\"member_id\":10,\"instruction\":\"continue_conversation\"}","tool_name":"request_member_selection"},{"created_at":"2026-05-19T05:46:06.000Z","id":"7F8D44E1-CC1E-4B45-809B-D6EB52604EEE","text":"好的，已确认成员。接下来我帮你把用药提醒也设置到日历中，方便按时用药。","kind":"text","updated_at":"2026-05-19T05:46:07.000Z"},{"id":"05D380D0-EFEC-4E7A-B27C-AAEA49B90DDB","created_at":"2026-05-19T05:46:07.000Z","anchor":{"type":"toolCall","value":"call_00_A5y5fAWfjP9brQSYPe6q3622"},"updated_at":"2026-05-19T05:46:20.000Z","kind":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_A5y5fAWfjP9brQSYPe6q3622","text":"正在使用工具：写入系统事件\n参数\n{\"type\": \"reminder\", \"title\": \"💧 普拉洛芬滴眼液 - 每天1次 每次1滴\", \"notes\": \"诊断：结膜炎。滴眼液（普南扑灵），每天1次，每次1滴。与其他滴眼液间隔5-10分钟。\", \"due_date\": \"2026-04-21T08:00:00+08:00\", \"priority\": 7}\n\n输出\n工具 write_system_event 已接入 SparkClient 路由。\nendpoint=未配置\nargs=due_date=2026-04-21T08:00:00+08:00, notes=诊断：结膜炎。滴眼液（普南扑灵），每天1次，每次1滴。与其他滴眼液间隔5-10分钟。, priority=7, title=💧 普拉洛芬滴眼液 - 每天1次 每次1滴, type=reminder\n当前为本地执行占位；如需真实联网调用，请在对应 toolClass 网关实现 HTTP 适配。","tool_name":"write_system_event"},{"created_at":"2026-05-19T05:46:20.000Z","id":"9A804FED-C562-4A7C-9064-9EB7AD1A7DE4","anchor":{"type":"toolCall","value":"call_00_A5y5fAWfjP9brQSYPe6q3622"},"events":[{"type":"reminder","id":"C2E7FF5A-9BA4-4D8D-9A8C-2A6F74094674","notes":"诊断：结膜炎。滴眼液（普南扑灵），每天1次，每次1滴。与其他滴眼液间隔5-10分钟。","title":"💧 普拉洛芬滴眼液 - 每天1次 每次1滴","date_text":"2026-04-21T08:00:00+08:00"}],"updated_at":"2026-05-19T05:46:20.000Z","kind":"events",