INFO 2026-05-19 15:27:36,502 accounts.api_io [request_id=47746F98-5A48-41CF-9AC9-258E10CE1EBC] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "192.168.31.192:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc5MjA2MTc3LCJpYXQiOjE3NzkyMDQzNzcsImp0aSI6IjVjYTk0NjlkOTI4YTRkZGJiNjA3ZTc1NzY5ZTRlMWUwIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjMifQ.EoqUMSZlDeNEiZDGOIcfnMNuySNiEXYFvoY33FcZpW4", "X-Request-Id": "47746F98-5A48-41CF-9AC9-258E10CE1EBC", "Content-Length": "2191"} body={"messages": [{"tombstone": false, "thread_max_tokens": 14096, "delivery_state": "pending", "thread_max_messages": 20, "thread_id": "50E2B9E0-A4A4-46AD-879A-871318ABB2A6", "role": "assistant", "thread_current_model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "25CB6194-1C8E-4E4E-8D9A-49CCCC663F68", "thread_top_p": 1, "blocks": [{"id": "BAC60031-8776-576D-897C-34946E4F3EE8", "updated_at": "2026-05-19T15:27:35.000Z", "text": "✅ 处方卡片已生成并保存，稍后会显示在下方。\n\n---\n\n### 📋 用药小贴士\n\n1. **普拉洛芬滴眼液**：非甾体抗炎药，用于缓解眼部炎症和不适，每天1次即可。\n2. **盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液**：抗组胺药，针对过敏性结膜炎的瘙痒、红肿，每天早晚各1次。\n3. 两种滴眼液如需同时使用，建议**间隔至少5分钟**，先滴一种，等吸收后再滴另一种。\n4. 滴眼液开封后**4周内用完**，过期应丢弃，避免污染。\n5. 如出现视力模糊、眼部刺痛加重等情况，及时复诊。\n\n有用药方面的疑问随时问我！", "created_at": "2026-05-19T15:27:35.000Z", "order_key": 1000, "revision": 1779204455625934, "kind": "text", "status": "ready"}, {"id": "D95C71F5-9881-5E4A-B7AC-FEF08E345612", "tool_name": "generate_structured_health_card", "updated_at": "2026-05-19T15:27:35.000Z", "text": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "created_at": "2026-05-19T15:27:35.000Z", "revision": 1779204455624838, "tool_call_id": "call_00_kgbIFC0XFkZJdcUyTk846952", "order_key": 2000, "kind": "tool", "status": "ready"}], "created_at": "2026-05-19T15:27:09.462Z", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-19T15:27:35.626Z", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}"}]}
