INFO 2026-05-19 15:27:36,521 accounts.api_io [request_id=47746F98-5A48-41CF-9AC9-258E10CE1EBC] HTTP 响应摘要: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ status=200 duration_ms=19 bytes=2118 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "POST, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"messages": [{"thread_id": "50e2b9e0-a4a4-46ad-879a-871318abb2a6", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "25cb6194-1c8e-4e4e-8d9a-49cccc663f68", "server_message_id": "b35ade7e-9230-40da-b817-85f1ed996631", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-19T15:27:09.462000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-19T15:27:36.513938+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "BAC60031-8776-576D-897C-34946E4F3EE8", "updated_at": "2026-05-19T15:27:35.000Z", "text": "✅ 处方卡片已生成并保存，稍后会显示在下方。\n\n---\n\n### 📋 用药小贴士\n\n1. **普拉洛芬滴眼液**：非甾体抗炎药，用于缓解眼部炎症和不适，每天1次即可。\n2. **盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液**：抗组胺药，针对过敏性结膜炎的瘙痒、红肿，每天早晚各1次。\n3. 两种滴眼液如需同时使用，建议**间隔至少5分钟**，先滴一种，等吸收后再滴另一种。\n4. 滴眼液开封后**4周内用完**，过期应丢弃，避免污染。\n5. 如出现视力模糊、眼部刺痛加重等情况，及时复诊。\n\n有用药方面的疑问随时问我！", "created_at": "2026-05-19T15:27:35.000Z", "order_key": 1000, "revision": 1779204455625934, "kind": "text", "status": "ready"}, {"id": "D95C71F5-9881-5E4A-B7AC-FEF08E345612", "tool_name": "generate_structured_health_card", "updated_at": "2026-05-19T15:27:35.000Z", "text": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "created_at": "2026-05-19T15:27:35.000Z", "revision": 1779204455624838, "tool_call_id": "call_00_kgbIFC0XFkZJdcUyTk846952", "order_key": 2000, "kind": "tool", "status": "ready"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}]}}
